{
 "description": "Bottles o' enchanting summoned with zero velocity 6 blocks above a stone floor (top y 200), 30 bottles 7 blocks apart, the player in creative far away. Batches are counted from the bottle's AddActor batch (packet receive times / 50 ms, rounded; +-1). Each bottle's AddActor has INVISIBLE set and CAN_SHOW_NAME clear and is followed in the same batch by its `disappeared` sound at the centre of its box (0.125 above its feet); one batch later a SetActorData clears INVISIBLE and sets CAN_SHOW_NAME; one batch after that comes `reappeared`, 0.05 lower (after its second move). On the hit, the potion-splash level event 2002 with the default potion colour comes at the top of the floor; one batch later the bottle is removed, the orbs appear at the same point and `glass` plays there, attributed to no actor.",
 "server": "BDS 1.26.51 (plain bedrock_server, no Endstone), harness world, difficulty normal, noon",
